! NOTE cdn.ymaws.com is a shared association CDN. If your Goggle dialect supports
! path patterns, narrow it to  cdn.ymaws.com/www.cilip.org.uk/*  before publishing.
! NOTE Subdomains carry real content: MLA chapters on *.mlanet.org, SCONUL Access on
! access.sconul.ac.uk, AfLIA on web.aflia.net. Confirm your dialect matches subdomains.
! NOTE cla.ca - the Canadian Library Association wound up in 2016 (successor CFLA-FCAB).
! Treat anything retrieved from it as historical unless the page says otherwise.
